                    "text": [
                      "The View Is\nNegotiable",
                      "Nib has been\noffered a\ncommission on a\nremarkably\naffordable rooftop",
                      "cottage. The\nphotograph\ncontains a",
                      "chimney, a sunset,\nand no apparent\ncottage.",
